From f9bdce4603fd02918a885387bb57ed396c9aed75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lapin UX <arnz.lee16@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:34:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Windows 11 volume/brightness flyout and admin
 permission prompt

All drawing lives in src/lapin.rs; COSMIC's files only gain call sites:
- osd_indicator: value pop-ups use lapin::value_osd (icon, thin bar, number)
- app: pop-ups 12 px above the taskbar; Lapin's taskbar isn't counted twice
- polkit_dialog: full-screen dimmed prompt via lapin::admin_prompt, with
  Show more details, Yes / No
- LAPIN_OSD_PREVIEW=volume|brightness|admin shows one at start for checks
- Only in a Lapin UX session (XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP has LapinUX, or
  LAPIN_UX_OSD=1): COSMIC's own session keeps COSMIC's pop-ups and prompt
